// Syncthing ignore patterns. Build caches and dependency folders churn
// constantly (created/deleted on every `npm run dev` or `rm -rf .next`),
// which causes "directory has been deleted ... but is not empty" conflicts
// when both sides regenerate them at slightly different times.
// These are reproducible from package.json / next build, so they don't
// need to sync between machines at all.

(?d).next
(?d)node_modules
(?d)out
(?d)build
(?d)coverage
.vercel
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.DS_Store
.env
.env*.local
